        Communication Enables Cooperation in <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span>: A Comparison with Curriculum-Based Approaches
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Madmoun%2C+H">Hachem Madmoun</a>, 
      
