        ExpertAgent: Enhancing Personalized Education through Dynamic Planning and <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> Long-Chain Reasoning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhu%2C+B">Binrong Zhu</a>, 
      
